  "custom_logic_notes": "Martingale lot doubling: OnTradeTransaction tracks deal results. If last closed deal (DEAL_ENTRY_OUT) had negative net profit (commission+swap+profit < 0), the next trade's lot is multiplied by 2.0. The Chinkou Span crossover for BUY compares against iClose at shift 10/11, and for SELL compares against iOpen at shift 10/11 (asymmetric). SL sanity check prevents opening trades where SL would already be triggered. Position counting filters by symbol AND magic number.",
