  "backtest_data_needs": "H1",
  "python_conversion_notes": "1. CMoneyFixedMargin from Expert/Money/MoneyFixedMargin.mqh must be reimplemented - it calculates lot size based on risk percentage of free margin with SL distance. 2. Martingale doubling logic in OnTradeTransaction needs careful replication - track last closed deal P&L. 3. Digit adjustment logic (multiply pips by 10 for 3/5 digit symbols) must be ported. 4. Trailing stop uses a two-stage check: price must exceed open by (trail_stop + trail_step) AND SL must be behind current price by (trail_stop + trail_step) before modifying. 5. The Chinkou Span entry uses shift 10/11 which corresponds to the default kijun_sen period offset - this is the standard Ichimoku displacement. 6. iOpen/iClose comparisons in SELL Chinkou condition use iOpen (not iClose) unlike the BUY condition which uses iClose - this asymmetry must be preserved.",
